Package: devjam-external-keyring
Version: 1.1-3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: OpenPGP keys for external apt repositories
 Signing keys of third-party apt repositories used on dev-jam systems,
 such as Signal, Syncthing, OnlyOffice, XanMod, Liquorix, XLibre,
 Waydroid, SR Research and the OpenSesame (cogscinl) PPA, installed in
 /usr/share/keyrings for use with Signed-By in deb822 .sources files.
